{"id":"626951","name":"紫藤花蒸菜","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/626951/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫藤花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"紫藤花。","img":"images/626951/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"采摘新鲜的紫藤花。","img":"images/626951/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入盆中。","img":"images/626951/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"择净。","img":"images/626951/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"紫藤花淘洗干净控水。","img":"images/626951/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"花已8分干，倒少许油拌匀，加少许面粉，拌匀或晃匀，再加少许盐和面粉，使花瓣上均匀包裹面粉，拌好面粉的花，如图所示。","img":"images/626951/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"水开后放入蒸笼里，不要放太厚。","img":"images/626951/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"水开后大火蒸五分钟。","img":"images/626951/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"蒸好后立即放入盆里，用筷子快速拌匀，使其散热。","img":"images/626951/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/626951/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"健康又美味。","img":"images/626951/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}